    "summary": "The US AI sector faces potential instability as debt-heavy investments clash with competitive, low-cost Chinese models, risking market volatility.\nThe post Jefferies’ Chris Wood warns US AI boom could end in massive capital destruction appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
